# ── MARK LIII — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json
config/.api_keys.lock
config/.api-keys-*
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
/config.json
/viewer/graph-data.js
/.galaxy-runtime/
/.runtime/
/memory/focus-ledger.jsonl

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
memory/browser_jobs/
memory/browser_use_profile/

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
.venv-browser/
.artifacts/
.pytest_cache/
config/mcp.json
config/integrations.json
config/browser-use/
config/browser_jobs/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# Desktop distributions and local packaging state
/release/
/desktop-smoke/
